                {
                  "text": "2026-09-02 · three jobs killed a minute apart → three debts. The only drains that ran were the next two kills' hooks, each inside the 120 s window: a kill appends a queue-operation line to the transcript at the instant SessionEnd fires, so the transcript is always fresh at hook time. No ending followed; the debts sat until an unrelated one. The alarm closes the gap.",
